{"verses":[{"number":1,"text":"LORD|strong=\"H3068\", don’t rebuke me|strong=\"H5921\"in|strong=\"H5921\"your|strong=\"H5921\"anger,  \nneither discipline me|strong=\"H5921\"in|strong=\"H5921\"your|strong=\"H5921\"wrath.   \n"},{"number":2,"text":"Have|strong=\"H3068\"mercy|strong=\"H3068\"on|strong=\"H3068\"me|strong=\"H3256\", LORD|strong=\"H3068\", for|strong=\"H3068\"I|strong=\"H3068\"am|strong=\"H3068\"faint.  \nLORD|strong=\"H3068\", heal me|strong=\"H3256\", for|strong=\"H3068\"my|strong=\"H3068\"bones are|strong=\"H3068\"troubled.   \n"},{"number":3,"text":"My|strong=\"H3068\"soul is|strong=\"H3068\"also|strong=\"H3068\"in|strong=\"H3068\"great anguish.  \nBut|strong=\"H3588\"you|strong=\"H3588\", LORD|strong=\"H3068\"—how|strong=\"H3588\"long?   \n"},{"number":4,"text":"Return, LORD|strong=\"H3068\". Deliver my|strong=\"H3068\"soul|strong=\"H5315\",  \nand|strong=\"H3068\"save|strong=\"H5315\"me|strong=\"H5315\"for|strong=\"H5704\"your|strong=\"H3068\"loving kindness’ sake.   \n"},{"number":5,"text":"For|strong=\"H3068\"in|strong=\"H3068\"death|strong=\"H5315\"there|strong=\"H7725\"is|strong=\"H3068\"no memory of|strong=\"H3068\"you|strong=\"H7725\".  \nIn|strong=\"H3068\"Sheol, who|strong=\"H3068\"shall|strong=\"H3068\"give|strong=\"H7725\"you|strong=\"H7725\"thanks?   \n"},{"number":6,"text":"I|strong=\"H3588\"am weary with|strong=\"H7585\"my|strong=\"H3588\"groaning.  \nEvery|strong=\"H3588\"night I|strong=\"H3588\"flood my|strong=\"H3588\"bed.  \nI|strong=\"H3588\"drench my|strong=\"H3588\"couch with|strong=\"H7585\"my|strong=\"H3588\"tears.   \n"},{"number":7,"text":"My|strong=\"H3605\"eye wastes away|strong=\"H3605\"because|strong=\"H3605\"of|strong=\"H3605\"grief.  \nIt|strong=\"H3915\"grows old because|strong=\"H3605\"of|strong=\"H3605\"all|strong=\"H3605\"my|strong=\"H3605\"adversaries.   \n"},{"number":8,"text":"Depart from|strong=\"H5869\"me|strong=\"H5869\", all|strong=\"H3605\"you|strong=\"H3605\"workers of|strong=\"H5869\"iniquity,  \nfor|strong=\"H3605\"the|strong=\"H3605\"LORD|strong=\"H3068\"has|strong=\"H5869\"heard the|strong=\"H3605\"voice of|strong=\"H5869\"my|strong=\"H3605\"weeping.   \n"},{"number":9,"text":"The|strong=\"H3605\"LORD|strong=\"H3068\"has|strong=\"H3068\"heard|strong=\"H8085\"my|strong=\"H8085\"supplication.  \nThe|strong=\"H3605\"LORD|strong=\"H3068\"accepts my|strong=\"H8085\"prayer.   \n"},{"number":10,"text":"May|strong=\"H3068\"all|strong=\"H3947\"my|strong=\"H8085\"enemies be|strong=\"H3068\"ashamed and|strong=\"H3068\"dismayed.  \nThey|strong=\"H3068\"shall|strong=\"H3068\"turn back|strong=\"H3947\", they|strong=\"H3068\"shall|strong=\"H3068\"be|strong=\"H3068\"disgraced suddenly.   \n"}]}
